      "message": "I\u0027m not fully convinced about allowing this to be set in the defaults module. For example, how is it expected to work for the scenario like below:\n```\ncc_defaults {\n  name: \"foo1\",\n  test_only: false,\n}\ncc_defaults {\n  name: \"foo2\",\n  test_only: true,\n}\ncc_library {\n  name: \"bar\",\n  defaults: [\"foo1\", \"foo2\"],\n}\n```\nIMHO values of both `test_only` and `top_level_test_target` properties should be scoped to the module level, and should not be propagated to other modules?\n\nAlso, `cc_defaults` is not being tested in `cc_test_only_property_test.go`.",
